      children: "Is flow mein poora adhyaya ek chakra ban jaata hai: sadharan se anubhav tak, anubhav se bhay tak, bhay se wapas sadharan mein. Osho kehte hain — yahi Gita ka sabse bada design hai: woh tumhe kabhi bahar le jaata hai, par hamesha wapas yahin laata hai — kyunki tumhara jeevan yahin hai. Vision ek visit hai, ghar nahin. Isliye Cosmic Glimpse Logger jaisa tool bhi yahi karta hai — jhalak ko log karo, score karo, aur phir RETURN_TO_ORDINARY ke 11 kadam karo. Anubhav ko yaad rakhna aur roz ke jeevan mein wapas aana — yahi vishvarupa darshana ki poori sadhna hai."
